WEBVTT

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:15.200
Nameless Lover, go back to your true form.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:22.450
Thinking back on it, when I first met
the Madam, she was pretty no-nonsense.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:27.580
Kana-<i>sama </i>and Yumemi-<i>sama </i>both take after her.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:34.790
Now, I have gone back to being
a regular girl, with no powers at all.

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:39.080
That is one of the things
I have always wanted to say.

00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:43.830
It is a good thing...

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:46.040
...that I made these, just in case.

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:05.410
<i>Tell me, do you remember?</i>

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:09.330
<i>Yes, the wondrous God-given power you have,</i>

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:15.200
<i>like sleight of hand without any tricks?</i>

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:19.000
<i>Tell me, have you already forgotten?</i>

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.160
<i>Those dreamlike, heart-shaped</i>

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:27.540
<i>flower-bouquet-like words of yours?</i>

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:33.790
<i>I'm sure, I'm sure</i>

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:37.410
<i>this key will open your treasure box</i>

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:43.660
<i>and let you remember them tonight</i>

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:46.540
<i>Farewell!</i>

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:47.830
<i>Watch me now,</i>

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:51.040
<i>I'm gently, quietly going to disappear,</i>

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:53.000
<i>so find me</i>

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:54.200
<i>I'm over here</i>

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:59.330
<i>Our long, long night of secrets is beginning</i>

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:00.620
<i>Come after me</i>

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:05.790
<i>Once you see the twinkle of my tearstains,</i>

00:02:05.790 --> 00:02:08.660
<i>catch me with your voice</i>

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:13.370
<i>and the magic words only the two of us know</i>

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:30.830
All three of you still have much to learn.
I think that is enough for today.

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:34.370
--Thank you very much.
--Thank you very much.

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:38.160
What is it, Ema-<i>san</i>?

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:40.410
Let's have you take the test again.

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:43.450
Test? You mean Mariah-<i>san</i>'s?

00:02:43.450 --> 00:02:46.120
Yes. To see whether or not you are worthy

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:49.620
to possess Maeve-<i>sama</i>'s masterpiece;

00:02:49.620 --> 00:02:54.120
whether or not you can live in
this mansion while facing many dangers;

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:56.540
as well as whether or not
you can refer to yourself

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:59.540
as a master thief who retrieves Artifacts.

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:02.120
<i>That </i>test.

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:07.000
I took it upon myself to make
a deal with Mariah-<i>sama </i>directly.

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:08.290
Huh?

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:11.080
If you pass your retest by
getting into a certain location

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:13.700
and succeed in retrieving an Artifact,

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:16.660
then Mariah-<i>sama </i>has agreed to accept you.

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:19.870
You mean if I pass,
we don't have to leave the house?

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:20.330
--Yes.

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:20.870
--And she won't take Gaugau away?
--Yes.

00:03:20.870 --> 00:03:22.160
--And she won't take Gaugau away?

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:23.540
Or my wand?

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:24.410
Correct.

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:26.660
She'll recognize me as the master thief Hatena?

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:29.660
Yes. She promised all of that.

00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:32.620
I can't believe it!

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:34.080
Why would she suddenly agree to that?

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.500
It could be a trap.

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:36.330
Huh?

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:39.250
The location you must get
into is a certain mansion.

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:42.750
The Artifact you must retrieve is this one.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:44.790
And if I get it back...?

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:48.040
Your examiner will have a number of Artifacts.

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:51.580
It is safe to assume that
your opposition will be intense.

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:53.120
Please do your best, okay?

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:56.580
Mm-hmm! If I get to be a master thief, I'm in!

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:58.830
All right, here.

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:01.120
This will be the master
thief Hatena's debut caper,

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:03.330
so I got all fired up and made this for you.

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:05.500
Thank you, Ema-<i>san</i>!

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:15.370
Yumemi, we're about to head down.

00:04:15.370 --> 00:04:19.120
Copy. Observing radio silence.

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:23.450
They got sent a notice,
so they're sure to be on high alert.

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:26.660
It takes a master thief to steal
something under those conditions.

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:29.660
Is that it?

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:31.580
Mm-hm.

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:34.250
No sensors have been tripped yet.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:36.830
Whoa...

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:38.870
Amazing...

00:04:38.870 --> 00:04:39.750
Let's hurry.

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:40.790
Mm-hm.

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:46.500
Huh? What? The painting?

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:52.790
Incredible, Gaugau!

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:54.500
Thank you, Gaugau.

00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:58.580
Gaugau is getting all buddy-buddy
with you, too. It's not fair.

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:01.750
Is this a hidden storeroom?

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:03.120
Looks like it.

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:06.700
Is something there?

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:09.500
Hang back, Makoto. Muff-<i>kun</i>!

00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:21.580
There's a bunch of them! Hatena, be careful!

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:26.580
Bring it on, you origami twerps!
Compared to Jeeves, you're nothing!

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:28.790
Muff-<i>kun</i>, scissors mode!

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:39.910
I can't let her do all the work.

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:43.750
Gaugau!

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:49.290
Rats! If I can't see you,
then I'll <i>make </i>it so I can see you!

00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:53.000
Go!

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:07.200
Illusion!

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:15.080
Whew! There!

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:22.450
I'm finished over here, too.

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:31.540
What is this place?

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:35.620
Welcome, my little kittens.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:43.330
It is my mission to steal sadness,
and turn it into smiles!

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:46.910
The master thief Hatena is on the scene!

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:48.410
Makoto...!

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:52.450
O-Oh, um... Ladies and gentlemen!

00:06:52.450 --> 00:06:57.120
I am the miraculous magician
that turns tears into smiles, Makoto!

00:06:57.120 --> 00:07:01.580
Thanks, Gaugau. This is a little embarrassing.

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:05.870
I'm here to take the appointed Artifact.

00:07:05.870 --> 00:07:08.540
Do you think it will be that easy?

00:07:08.540 --> 00:07:12.910
Ah! That's Ema-<i>san</i>'s
maid uniform! Why is it here?

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:16.870
Huh? But Ema-<i>san </i>is wearing
her maid uniform today.

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:23.910
That one is a fake. This is the
authentic one, given to me by Mariah.

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:26.910
If I drive you out, it will become mine to keep.

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:27.950
Oh, no...

00:07:27.950 --> 00:07:30.750
Ema-<i>san </i>treasures that.

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:34.620
Lock it away, Mysteric Box.

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:40.580
Now what will you do?

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:41.660
Give it back!

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:44.040
All right, let the test begin.

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:50.790
She's fast! Just like Jeeves-<i>san</i>!

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:59.500
Those weapons--is it Mariah-<i>san</i>?
It couldn't be...

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.370
Muff-<i>kun</i>, Solais!

00:08:08.160 --> 00:08:10.000
Now, who's next?

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:13.830
Why, you...! Get off me!

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:18.200
Is that an Artifact, as well?

00:08:23.660 --> 00:08:24.870
Gaugau!

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:32.000
You're a tough one.

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:40.040
Gaugau...

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:42.290
You'll pay for that.

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:46.410
Smile Stick! Twin Blade!

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:48.540
Let's show her what we've been practicing!

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:51.450
Ho... Well, give me all you've got.

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:14.370
Hatena!

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:19.620
Super-Surefire mode! Muff-<i>kun</i>, Hyper...

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:22.200
...Punch!

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:35.950
You did it! Nicely done, master thief Hatena!

00:09:40.540 --> 00:09:42.830
Who exactly is that?

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:47.160
We ended up passing the test,
so what does it matter?

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:48.290
"Hatena was here!"
Here.

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:49.830
"Hatena was here!"

00:09:53.830 --> 00:09:55.830
--Tominozawa-<i>san</i>?!
--Tominozawa-<i>san</i>?!

00:09:57.750 --> 00:10:01.200
All the Artifacts belong to me...

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:03.330
Then this mansion is...

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:05.950
I knew it.

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:07.330
Why didn't you say so?

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:08.870
Never mind that right now...

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:18.200
Welcome home, my precious!

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:21.250
I am glad to see you are safe, Mistress Kana.

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:26.580
Yeah, of course. This is becoming
a pattern. I get it, my precious.

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:30.040
Congratulations on a successful first mission.

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:33.660
Ema-<i>san</i>, why would you put up
something so important to you?

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:36.620
Heh, heh, no special reason.

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:41.330
My maidcraft has really paid off
to see you fighting so hard

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:43.750
to take back something so dear to me.

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:49.500
By the way, "maidcraft" is not a word
from a manga; it is my own creation.

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:54.830
Yes, I did take it back. But Ema-<i>san</i>,
your precious Artifact is...

00:10:56.910 --> 00:10:58.370
We're sorry.

00:11:00.870 --> 00:11:05.370
It is all right. This is my
own private Artifact.

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:08.160
I was prepared for
something like this to happen.

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:09.870
No, but...

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:14.580
Not to worry. If I ask Maeve-<i>sama</i>
to repair it, I know she will.

00:11:14.580 --> 00:11:18.750
Oh, yeah... Once Mother finally comes home...

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:23.120
Now Mariah-<i>sama </i>will have
no choice but to recognize you.

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:26.160
All right, I will go report in with Mariah-<i>sama</i>.

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:28.000
Please allow me to handle it from here.

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:42.000
Do you two know what that brooch--
what her maid uniform is to her?

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:46.080
I've heard that the brooch is
a treasure she got from Mother.

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:50.500
I see. Apparently, your
exercise is not finished yet.

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:57.830
Ema-<i>san </i>put up her own personal
Artifact so I could have a retest?

00:12:00.200 --> 00:12:02.910
Why would she do that?

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:05.330
Master, when you say the exercise isn't over,

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:08.040
do you mean we should
think about the reason why?

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:13.830
Makoto-<i>kun</i>, up on the stage,
a magician can't get help from anyone else.

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:17.830
I want you to pass Mariah's exercise,
Master Gregory's exercise,

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:21.660
not to mention my exercise.

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:22.790
Right.

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:25.000
I'll give you one hint, though.

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:30.540
You know that Jeeves is an Artifact,
and a part of the mansion, right?

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:31.870
Mm-hmm.

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:37.660
All right, Jeeves, about how many years
have you served as the butler here?

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:41.450
I would say it has probably been over 200 years.

00:12:41.450 --> 00:12:43.200
200 years?!

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:48.540
It is unavoidable that Maeve's
Artifacts will fall into the wrong hands.

00:12:48.540 --> 00:12:53.120
That is why we needed this mansion.
The mansion is something

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:55.620
that Maeve stole from Lároutir Village.

00:12:58.450 --> 00:13:03.000
When it happened, I was easily
captured by Mother Morrigan.

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:12.950
After Maeve and her mother talked it out,

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:16.620
the mansion ended up being relocated to Japan.

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:21.000
It was as though we halfway
took over it. Day by day,

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:25.910
we were watched over by
the eminent Artifact Jeeves, here.

00:13:25.910 --> 00:13:27.910
I appreciate you saying that.

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:32.910
So Jeeves himself is a
treasure that everyone wants.

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:35.200
Do you understand the
fragile balance at work here?

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:37.950
You're saying that we're holding you back?

00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:42.910
No, Kana. Makoto-<i>kun</i>,
think hard about what you should do.

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:46.910
Come in.

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:55.290
This is one of the seven Artifacts I have.

00:13:55.290 --> 00:13:58.450
It can create a sequestered space on command.

00:13:58.450 --> 00:14:01.910
Does that imply that you
can keep me locked up in here?

00:14:01.910 --> 00:14:05.830
It would be easy, now that
you are without your Artifact.

00:14:05.830 --> 00:14:06.910
Have a seat.

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:09.120
No thank you. I am a maid.

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:10.290
Sit down.

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:16.500
I know how it turned out.
Old Lady Tominozawa called me in tears.

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:18.910
Then that will save me
the trouble of explaining.

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:25.200
As promised, the mistresses are
free to live in the mansion, then?

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:28.120
You think I keep my promises?

00:14:28.120 --> 00:14:33.620
Yes, I believe you. You are,
if nothing else, Maeve-<i>sama</i>'s sister.

00:14:33.620 --> 00:14:40.330
Hmph. She's the kind of sister who ran off
and eloped while I was away at school.

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:43.330
You're sure you're okay with this?

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:47.250
It got a little scraped up, but
I do not think it will be a problem.

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:54.250
Here I was, trying to ensure
my nieces did not get into any danger...

00:14:54.250 --> 00:14:56.160
Do you realize what you're doing?

00:14:56.160 --> 00:15:03.450
You're dragging those young children
into the same fate that I went through.

00:15:05.950 --> 00:15:09.200
Mariah-<i>san</i>, that is very kind of you.

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:13.500
I-I am only carrying out
the wishes of the village!

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:23.540
You're going to become a robber
and take back those Artifacts, aren't you?

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:26.200
At least call me a master thief.

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:33.620
Am I... going to be abandoned again?

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:36.250
No, don't be silly, Ema.

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:43.410
If I'm being silly, it's because
of you, Maeve-<i>sama</i>. I... I...

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:49.200
Very well. But the path ahead
is a dangerous one.

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:52.790
I will test you to see if
you can follow it with me.

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:58.540
I don't even want to
remember the test that followed.

00:15:58.540 --> 00:16:03.410
Honestly, Jeeves-<i>san</i>, what do
you take a nine-year-old girl for?

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:10.950
Thank you, Nameless Lover.

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:15.620
How come?!

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:20.410
Because I invited her. Here, Tomiko,
the reward you were promised.

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:25.410
At last, you're back, my Tomi-Tomi Slime!

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:27.250
But Mariah-<i>san</i>, why?

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:31.950
It seems that Tominozawa-<i>sama</i>
made a contract with Lároutir Village.

00:16:31.950 --> 00:16:36.330
Upon her death, her collection
will be donated to the village.

00:16:36.330 --> 00:16:40.910
As such, I hired Tomiko as
the examiner for your retest.

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:43.540
Ah, Jeeves...

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:47.410
Please have the other,
damaged Artifact repaired.

00:16:47.410 --> 00:16:50.330
Yes, I'll ask my sister to see to it.

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:54.790
Mother can repair broken Artifacts?

00:16:54.790 --> 00:16:56.200
Of course she can.

00:16:56.200 --> 00:17:00.290
As I understand it, practical magicians
are able to look at an Artifact

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:04.120
and read its true name, toll,
and creation method from its crest.

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:10.660
Is that...?

00:17:10.660 --> 00:17:14.870
With this power, we can fix Ema-<i>san</i>'s Artifact!

00:17:14.870 --> 00:17:16.870
Ema-<i>san</i>, we need a favor!

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:21.700
You are not about to say
you came to apologize, are you?

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:24.500
No. I tried something.

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:27.620
As long as we have Yumemi's
power and the Lároutir crest,

00:17:27.620 --> 00:17:31.950
we figured out how to repair an Artifact
without Mother even being here!

00:17:31.950 --> 00:17:35.700
Please let us fix your brooch!

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:54.160
It's amazing...

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:58.450
Mother's Artifact is drawing
the magic power right out of me.

00:17:58.450 --> 00:18:01.160
Mistress Yumemi, do not overexert yourself.

00:18:05.580 --> 00:18:10.200
The kid was abandoned,
but I took her in and raised her.

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:15.700
The rest of you, leave.

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:27.450
That belongs to you, doesn't it?

00:18:29.410 --> 00:18:31.750
I'm sorry I didn't get here sooner.

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:36.870
Do you know who I am?

00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:43.540
That maid uniform and brooch are very
dangerous. Would you let me keep them?

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:46.660
No. Absolutely not these.

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:51.910
These are the only things
I have from Papa and Mama.

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:58.790
I see. In that case, I don't have much choice.

00:18:58.790 --> 00:19:01.160
I'll have to steal <i>you </i>along with them.

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:09.830
It would appear that you have witnessed
something embarrassing for me.

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:12.700
Ema-<i>san</i>, was that...?

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:15.330
When my parents helped me to escape,

00:19:15.330 --> 00:19:17.910
the last thing they left me
was the maid uniform.

00:19:17.910 --> 00:19:23.660
Maeve-<i>sama </i>made it into an
Artifact that I could wear at all times.

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:27.370
You offered up something
that precious to you for our sake?

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:30.620
Thank you very much, Kana-<i>sama</i>.

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:34.080
This brooch's name is Nameless Lover.

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:38.620
It's a testament of love from
my unknown parents, to me,

00:19:38.620 --> 00:19:41.450
who they never named.

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:45.410
Ema-<i>san</i>, you dummy!
If we'd failed to pass that test...

00:19:45.410 --> 00:19:49.000
I was absolutely convinced
that you would not fail.

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:53.660
And even if it did not go well,
I do not think I would have regretted it.

00:19:53.660 --> 00:19:55.500
Ema-<i>san</i>...

00:19:55.500 --> 00:20:00.000
All right, once I bathe and scrub
myself clean, I will put it back on.

00:20:22.370 --> 00:20:25.410
I wanted to be alone.

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:31.370
I had to apologize to you
for breaking your Artifact.

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:36.410
There is nothing to apologize for.
I was the one who decided to do this.

00:20:36.410 --> 00:20:39.160
I knew you would say that.

00:20:39.160 --> 00:20:45.200
But, even so, I want you
to let me say I'm sorry.

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:47.950
Being the master thief Hatena is my dream.

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:53.700
I want to be a master thief who
steals sadness and turns it to smiles.

00:20:53.700 --> 00:21:00.330
I'm so sorry that I put you
through this and made you so sad.

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:01.410
My...

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:05.950
What a headstrong and wonderful apology.

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:08.830
You are right.

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:11.330
Please become an even better master thief,

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:15.950
and snatch away all of the tears
from little children like I was,

00:21:15.950 --> 00:21:18.620
master thief Hatena-<i>sama</i>.

00:21:18.620 --> 00:21:19.700
Mm-hmm.

00:21:28.790 --> 00:21:30.080
That's foul play!

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:32.870
It's a childish trick! It's not fair!

00:21:32.870 --> 00:21:34.870
What are you talking about, Dina?

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:36.910
It's a magic trick that you can't do, Dina-<i>kun</i>,

00:21:36.910 --> 00:21:39.080
so I'd say Makoto-<i>kun </i>passes.

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:41.000
That is just wrong!

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:43.790
It is classic saw-a-person-in-half magic!

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:46.910
I accept you as my apprentice.
Keep working at it.

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:48.200
Right!

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:53.120
By working together, you passed my exercise.

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:54.330
Nice work.

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:55.580
Master...

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:56.950
Papa...

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:01.950
No fair. I don't accept this.

00:22:02.910 --> 00:22:08.750
<i>My path now begins</i>

00:22:08.750 --> 00:22:17.120
<i>I've unleashed the hidden light of one future</i>

00:22:20.870 --> 00:22:23.540
<i>I've been on the hunt</i>

00:22:23.540 --> 00:22:27.580
<i>to find my furthest dreams</i>

00:22:27.580 --> 00:22:30.750
<i>I want to shine even brighter</i>

00:22:30.750 --> 00:22:35.830
<i>The "someday" that my former self prayed for</i>

00:22:35.830 --> 00:22:41.000
<i>is still far away, but I'll catch up</i>

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:46.040
<i>"Miracle" is such an embarrassingly vague word</i>

00:22:46.040 --> 00:22:51.200
<i>My timeframe has neither forever nor a moment</i>

00:22:51.200 --> 00:22:58.450
<i>I move forward one step at a time to my voice</i>

00:22:58.450 --> 00:23:02.250
<i>No matter what awaits me</i>

00:23:02.250 --> 00:23:03.580
<i>beyond this pain</i>

00:23:03.580 --> 00:23:05.830
<i>I'll once again, yes once again</i>

00:23:05.830 --> 00:23:08.580
<i>leap up and shine</i>

00:23:08.580 --> 00:23:12.410
<i>Yeah, I'll put into words</i>

00:23:12.410 --> 00:23:13.950
<i>the view laid out before me</i>

00:23:13.950 --> 00:23:17.200
<i>and let it ring out dozens,</i>

00:23:17.200 --> 00:23:20.870
<i>even hundreds of times</i>

00:23:20.870 --> 00:23:25.200
<i>What color do you suppose love is?</i>

00:23:25.200 --> 00:23:30.870
<i>I've unleashed my hidden light</i>

00:23:32.620 --> 00:23:39.370
"Have you had anything great happen lately?"

00:23:40.410 --> 00:23:52.450
"Ema"

00:23:52.450 --> 00:24:02.370
"See you next time"
